{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36413","headline":"春日宿崇贤里 · 罗邺","name":"春日宿崇贤里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳暗榆飞春日深，水边门巷独来寻。\n旧山共是经年别，新句相逢竟夕吟。\n枕近禁街闻晓鼓，月当高竹见栖禽。\n劳歌莫问秋风计，恐起江河垂钓心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}